  << /ActualText (Gathered strain and acceleration data from a lawnmower being put through a durability test\056 Sensors placed in areas only sensitive to vertical loading\056 Wrote MATLAB script to calculate damage accrued using rainflow cycle counting\056 Correlated logged data to vertical movement of hydraulic actuators under lawnmower wheels\054 calibrated using damage\056 Hydraulic test setup will be used to decrease test time and take parts to failure\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 2072 0 R
     /Pg 2061 0 R
